      "narration": "How much did Newton lose? The number everyone quotes is wrong. Family legend says twenty thousand pounds. Historian Andrew Odlyzko rebuilt his accounts from bank records, and estimates the loss at more than ten thousand. Worse, had Newton simply kept his early profits, he would have ended up more than twice as rich.",
